  "identifier": "gow-ragnarok-hardrefill-guide-2026",
  "headline": "Hardrefill the Callous guide (God of War Ragnarok): evade guard-break pressure, punish slam recoveries",
  "description": "Hardrefill is safer when you evade guard-break chains and punish the jump-slam recovery instead of forcing parries.",
  "keywords": [
    "hardrefill the callous guide",
    "berserker",
    "jump slam",
    "guard break",
    "strategy"
  ],
  "articleBody": "1) Failure mode\n- trying to parry through guard-break pressure\n- early dodges into delayed slams\n\n2) Prep\n- prefer evasion over forced parries\n- short runics for guaranteed confirms\n\n3) Fixed plan\n1) evade chains to force whiffs\n2) dodge the jump slam late (watch the landing)\n3) punish once, then disengage\n\n4) Three punish windows\n- jump-slam recovery\n- heavy swing follow-through\n- end of gap-closers\n\nRelated: return to the all-Berserkers index for route and locations.",
